/// *
///  * |--------------------------------------------------------------------------
///  * | Admin Intelligence Agent
///  * |--------------------------------------------------------------------------
///  * | Institution-wide, one layer above Analytics ("aggregates the
///  * | aggregators, one level up") — every model here uses the same polymorphic
///  * | (scopeType, scopeId) pattern Analytics/Teacher Insight already
///  * | established for one column that can't hard-FK several heterogeneous
///  * | parent tables, since this agent spans PLATFORM/DEPARTMENT/FACULTY/
///  * | COURSE/STUDENT scope all at once.
///  * |
///  * | No Department/Faculty/Semester/Revenue/Subscription/SystemLog/AuditLog
///  * | model exists anywhere else in this schema (see index.js doc for the
///  * | full domain-gap list). DEPARTMENT scope's scopeId is Course.category
///  * | (the only real institutional grouping dimension this LMS has) and
///  * | FACULTY scope's scopeId is a User.id with role=INSTRUCTOR — same
///  * | "instructorId is a plain loose reference, never a hard FK to User"
///  * | convention Teacher Insight already uses for TeachingRecommendation.
///  * |
///  * | Every model doubles as its own time-series table (date-bucketed, unique
